description = "Experimental Atari 7800 core with NTSC and PAL timing, the ProSystem RetroPad layout, fast boot or an optional BIOS, and RetroAchievements memory maps. Load-selected XBoard and XM RAM/POKEY/HSC subset; no YM2151, Covox/ADPCM, internal XM BIOS or full-XM services. Retail compatibility and physical calibration remain limited."
